Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value STATUS (up|down|administratively down|deleted)
Value PROTOCOL (.+?)
Value List ADDRESSES (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+/\d+)
Value VRF ([^"]+)

# One record per interface block (campus-wan and vpn-fabric labs, IOS-XE 17): its own
# addresses (primary and secondary) and its VRF, which follows them. Every other block
# line is known feature state; a line with an address in another phrasing is refused.
Start
  ^\S+ is (up|down|administratively down|deleted), line protocol is -> Continue.Record
  ^${INTERFACE} is ${STATUS}, line protocol is ${PROTOCOL}\s*$$
  ^\s+Internet address is ${ADDRESSES}\s*$$
  ^\s+Secondary address ${ADDRESSES}\s*$$
  ^\s+VPN Routing/Forwarding "${VRF}"\s*$$
  ^\s+(Broadcast address is|Multicast reserved groups joined:|Helper address(es)? (is|are)|Interface is unnumbered\.)(\s.*)?$$
  ^\s+.*\b\d{1,3}(\.\d{1,3}){3}\b -> Error "unrecognized address line"
  ^\s+\S.*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized show ip interface line"
